# Shepherd of the Clouds: "if you control a Mount" is about the Shepherd's controller. Bot2 controls Bulwark Ox, Bot1 controls no Mount, so
# Bot1's Alaborn Trooper (mana value 3, exactly at the limit) goes to its hand and not to the battlefield. Bot2's own Lightning Bolt
# (not a permanent card) is in Bot2's graveyard, and the Trooper is the only card Bot1 may target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Alaborn Trooper
Shepherd of the Clouds
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Bulwark Ox
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

